{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MedicineTimes Pro 是一款用藥管理工具，協助用家集中整理處方藥、成藥、維他命與保健品，並追蹤有效期與存量。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合每日服用保健品、需要長期服藥或管理家庭藥箱的人士。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-82.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>有效期與存量雙重提醒</h2>\n<p>App 會記錄每次服藥與補充時間；系統自動監測有效期，在藥物過期前發出提醒，並於存量偏低時通知用家及早補貨，避免誤服過期藥物或中途斷藥。用家可按類型或存放位置分類，配合搜尋與篩選找出所需藥物；亦可把特定藥物標記為私人，保障健康資料。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-514-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-515-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-516-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-517-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-518-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-519-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MedicineTimes Pro</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/medicinetimes-pro/id6760583149?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.079024+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:35.038688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:47.156970+00:00","content_hash":"1ced9ce15f782ec3ae0d57cbf67de5ea50eac679871ccd60192b209d6bdaffa7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}